The prayer timeout can be extremely large and depends on your
level. At best (50% times) it will be below 350turns. At worst it can
be
(at XL <=15)  3500 turns. For every next 2 levels the max increases by
700 turns. So be very careful of praying without testing.

You can also transform into a foodless monster like a Lich. They dont'
eat,
they don't breath, have a nice AC and can wear all armour and can fly.
That last part may be a bit problematic.

For appeasing your deity, you need a chaotic altar. You cannot convert
an altar
till your deity is angry because you will? get converted to the altars
alignment.

And since you are chaotic normal monsters won't cut it for appeasement.

